PTX MP+fence-restrict-cta+global
"As MP+fence-restrict-cta+shared with the data in global memory: the restricted fence orders only operations on the CTA's shared memory (22626, D18). Expected: allowed."
{
d=0;
f=0;
P1:r0=0;
P1:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0                         | P1@cta 1,cluster 0,gpu 0 ;
 st.weak.global d, 1                              | ld.relaxed.cluster r0, f ;
 fence.release.sync_restrict::shared::cta.cluster | fence.acq_rel.cluster    ;
 st.relaxed.cluster f, 1                          | ld.weak.global r1, d     ;
exists
(P1:r0 == 1 /\ P1:r1 == 0)
